      "blocker": "The current anonymous product-lite replay for P417985 with preferredSku 2234219 returned HTTP 200 JSON, but productDetails contained only brand, displayName and productId. The in-memory shape inspection found no description or ingredient fields, and the maintained client reported not_returned_by_observed_product_api. The sanitized negative observation is verification/remaining-sephora-2026-10-16/product-description-shape.json; it records expectedResultVerified=false and is deliberately not registered as positive live capability evidence. Sephora’s source-linked /api/content/pageProduct helper returns generic rather than product-specific copy, and product-page documents returned 403 in prior bounded inspection; product description and ingredients remain unavailable and are not fabricated."
